<div class="flex flex-col gap-10"><div class="bg-surface-container-low border border-surface-container-highest rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-4 border-b border-surface-container-high/60 pb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-cyan-accent"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">storefront</span><span class="font-bold tracking-wider uppercase">ORIGIN CHRONICLE — THE SARI-SARI STORE BEGINNINGS</span></div><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-coral-accent bg-surface-container px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-coral-accent/20">Est. Davao City, Philippines</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 font-sans text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"><p class="">LuchTech was founded in Davao City, Philippines, from an unassuming origin: a single workspace set up inside a family sari-sari store, operating under a handwritten paper sign taped against the wall. Without venture funding or corporate offices, the venture started strictly on engineering grit, focused execution, and a commitment to sovereign, clean-code systems.</p><p class="">Following an early trial period and a challenging initial team iteration, founder James Carlo Luchavez rebuilt LuchTech from the foundations up. He assembled a loyal group of close friends and trusted engineers who shared an uncompromising commitment to technical rigor. Working through late-night sprint sessions, this dedicated crew transformed that corner store desk into a high-caliber technical firm and engineered <strong class="text-white font-semibold">LaraKube</strong>—LuchTech's flagship open-source sovereign cloud PaaS enabling global development teams to orchestrate modern software without cloud lock-in.</p><p class="">Today, whether architecting multi-tenant SaaS platforms, sovereign cloud infrastructure, or enterprise-scale web applications for international clients, LuchTech adheres strictly to this grounded builder-first ethos. Clients engage directly with principal craftsmen who take absolute ownership and accountability from initial blueprint to production launch.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 font-mono text-xs pt-6 border-t border-surface-container-high/60"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container/60 border border-surface-container-high"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-coral-accent">10+</span><span class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Years Architecting</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container/60 border border-surface-container-high"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-accent">30+</span><span class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Systems Shipped</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container/60 border border-surface-container-high"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400">100%</span><span class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Direct Access</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container/60 border border-surface-container-high"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-lavender">0%</span><span class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Agency Bloat</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-low border border-surface-container-highest rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-xl flex flex-col gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-surface-container-high/60 pb-5"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-slate-lavender font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">group</span><span class="">ENGINEERING COLLECTIVE &amp; BUILDERS</span></div><h3 class="font-mono text-xl font-bold t